/**

@page applications_exahype2_euler Euler

# How to Build and Run

For a general overview and all options on how to retrieve and configure the project, refer to @ref page_installation_home.

    cd myPeanoDirectory
    pip3 install -e .
    mkdir build && cd build
    CC=gcc CXX=g++ cmake ..
    make -j && make test
    cd ../applications/exahype2/euler/scenario/
    python3 scenario.py

Where `CC=gcc CXX=g++` can be any set of compilers.

# Visualise the Simulation Output

    python3 -m visualisation.convert_to_vtu solutions/solution-.peano-patch-file

# Scenarios

\li \subpage applications_exahype2_euler_breaking_dam
\li \subpage applications_exahype2_euler_channel_flow
\li \subpage applications_exahype2_euler_gaussian_bell
\li \subpage applications_exahype2_euler_gaussian_explosion
\li \subpage applications_exahype2_euler_point_explosion
\li \subpage applications_exahype2_euler_taylor_green_vortex

